    "runtimeNotes": [
      "Cels12,14,16 receive localized imagegen blade repairs. Other thirteen source cels are unchanged.",
      "One-handed transition appears briefly at cel12, returns two-handed13-15, then frees the rear arm16 for the rush.",
      "Real-time and in-engine playback not visually verified.",
      "Leg silhouettes alternate, but stride spacing is uneven and leg occlusion near cels7-10 needs actual-size playback review. This is not yet an accepted polished run loop.",
      "Root translations only; engine supplies travel. No aura or trail is baked into body.",
      "Blade angles make several small corrective swings during recovery rather than a perfectly monotonic return.",
      "Manual registration aligns foot/hip roots without changing source scale.",
      "Source neighboring silhouettes are disjoint but crop rectangles overlap; exact nearest-component ownership mask removes only unrelated neighbors.",
      "Projected body height changes at16-to17 launch and32-to33 braking boundaries. Head/weapon proportions vary mildly across source sheets; review these transitions in engine."
